        "title": "[Medium] Close the picker when its slab host unmounts",
        "body": "With a valid quote, open the inline picker and click the still-accessible trade confirmation button outside the slabs. `TradeWidgetModals` replaces the form, removing this portal target, while `SelectTokenWidget` remains mounted and logically open. The picker can remain attached to detached DOM, with body scrolling locked and quote polling paused. Close the selector when its host disappears, or prevent form-replacing actions while it is open.",
