          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "[Medium] Dispatch Escape to the active nested view",
        "body": "Open Manage, start importing a token or list, then press Escape. This handler clears only `isManageWidgetOpen`; `tokenToImport` or `listToImport` still takes precedence, so the import screen remains unchanged. A second Escape closes the entire picker. List consent similarly leaves `listToToggle` pending. Dispatch to the active view\u2019s Back/Cancel handler so Escape clears the appropriate pending state and returns one level.",
        "confidence_score": 0.99,
        "priority": 2,
        "code_location": {
          "file_path": "/Users/scep/ophis-asset-swap-local/apps/frontend/apps/cowswap-frontend/src/modules/tokensList/containers/SelectTokenWidget/internal/SelectTokenModal.tsx",
          "line_range": {
            "start": 88,
            "end": 91
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "[Medium] Add a Suspense boundary around the live motion fields",
        "body": "`AssetSwapFields` renders lazy `MotionDiv` and `MotionButton` components, but the standard swap route has no enclosing Suspense boundary. Opening the live preview before visiting the lab therefore suspends at the application root while Framer Motion loads, leaving a blank initial screen or stale previous route without loading feedback. Wrap the live fields in a local Suspense boundary; the lab route\u2019s boundary does not cover this path.",
        "confidence_score": 0.96,
